ItemDisplay[UNI !ID !IN_TOWN !(rin OR amu)]: %GOLD%Unique%CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[SET !ID !IN_TOWN !(rin OR amu)]: %GREEN%Set%CONTINUE%

